\chapter{Abstract}
AXIOM-FP is a unified mathematical, computational, and formal-logical framework 
describing the emergence, expansion, and extinction of technological civilizations 
across the Milky Way. The theory integrates stellar density fields, abiogenesis 
probability distributions, relativistic expansion cones, and catastrophic filter 
dynamics into a closed-form Fermi-style silent-void function. The model is 
constructed to be fully formalizable in dependent type theory and amenable to 
Level-3 machine-checked validation using interactive theorem provers such as Lean 
and Coq.

