\section{The Fermi Paradox as a Mathematical Problem}
The classical Fermi Paradox highlights the tension between the galaxy's vast 
stellar population and the absence of detectable extraterrestrial civilizations. 
AXIOM-FP reframes this paradox as a rigorous mathematical problem, enabling 
formal verification and computational simulation at galactic scale.

\section{Objectives of AXIOM-FP}
\begin{itemize}
\item Construct a closed-form mathematical law governing galactic civilization dynamics.
\item Integrate astrophysical, biological, and technological parameters.
\item Provide a pathway for machine-checked formal proof verification.
\item Establish a quantitative boundary for galactic silence.
\end{itemize}

